WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.870
Cook 12 ounces of pasta until al dente. Reserve half a cup of pasta water, then drain.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:19.337
Season the diced chicken. Sauté in olive oil until the center of the pieces reaches 165°F. Transfer to a clean plate.

00:00:19.337 --> 00:00:27.270
Lower the heat. Cook minced garlic for about 30 seconds, then add chicken broth and heavy cream.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:34.540
Simmer the sauce gently. Stir in grated Parmesan until smooth; avoid a hard boil.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:42.615
Return the cooked chicken, pasta and spinach to the pan. Toss until spinach wilts and everything is hot.

00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:51.148
Loosen the sauce with reserved pasta water as needed. Taste, adjust salt and pepper, and serve warm.
